<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Constraint that intervenes on the visual or typographic arrangement of the text, where the spatial layout of letters/words on the page is itself part of the rule. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme and skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Costrizione che interviene sulla disposizione visiva o tipografica del testo, in cui l'impaginazione spaziale di lettere/parole sulla pagina è essa stessa parte della regola. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme e skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Visual constraint</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Costrizione visiva</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
